# Line endings are fixed in the repository, not left to each checkout's core.autocrlf: the claims registry
# (docs/claims/registry.json) pins evidence files by the SHA-256 of their exact bytes, so a CRLF checkout
# on Windows would make every pin mismatch. Binary files are detected automatically.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The Maven wrapper's Windows batch file is committed with CRLF; leave its bytes alone.
*.cmd -text
